  "summary": "Malicious code in staycasinos (npm)",
  "details": "Package staycasinos@1.0.0 is an SEO-spam package promoting casino affiliate links. It contains an empty JavaScript stub (module.exports = {}) and a README.md with marketing text and outbound links to staycasino[.]club and staycasino.bet. The package has no lifecycle hooks, no executable code, and no network-exfiltration behaviour — it is an inert placeholder published as part of a known malicious campaign.",
